WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,020
Go to the production team warehouse to pick up tools

2
00:00:02,020 --> 00:00:07,380
Today I went to the back slope with three groups to dig and understand.

3
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:16,120
Word spread about what happened at the foot of the mountain last night

4
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:18,030
Go in and pick out a casting head

5
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:19,910
Today three groups went to the back slope to plow the ground.

6
00:00:19,910 --> 00:00:20,910
Follow Lao Zhaotou

7
00:00:20,910 --> 00:00:21,950
Thank you, Sister Li Kuai

8
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:28,410
Don’t forget melon seeds

9
00:00:28,410 --> 00:00:30,100
And a few corn kernels

10
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:39,740
It depends on whether you can survive

11
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:48,770
Good news little brother

12
00:00:48,770 --> 00:00:50,930
Your baby found a buyer

13
00:00:50,930 --> 00:00:53,130
Why do you say that the other party has a lot of background?

14
00:00:53,130 --> 00:00:54,490
Play it safe and be generous

15
00:00:54,490 --> 00:00:55,490
One Thousand and Five Tiger Skins

16
00:00:55,490 --> 00:00:56,890
Tiger meat and tiger bones two thousand three

17
00:00:56,890 --> 00:00:57,970
A total of three thousand eighty
